00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:27.020
<b>An Underground Corridor</b>

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:43.450
I wonder if the ceiling will collapse?

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:55.380
I'm so sorry! Milady, are you alright?

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:57.930
It was a shock, but I'm alright.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.340
And you, Loran?

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:02.010
Please, hold on. I'll let you down.

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:03.310
Right here?

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:05.930
We seem to be in the underground Cavern that Sid mentioned.

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:08.440
It's too dangerous for us to head to the surface.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:10.270
We'll wait here for a little while.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.520
Yes.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:14.110
Is the White Doll alright after going through that?

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:16.940
It looked like it took a bad hit.

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:21.820
Loran!?

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:25.910
Are you alright?

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:29.740
Yeah. I just fell. I'm fine.

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:33.500
What do you mean you're alright?

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.630
That hurt...

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.970
I'm sorry.

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:38.720
Wait there a moment.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.840
Sure.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.140
I don't have a handkerchief...

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.710
Handkerchief?

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:47.520
Your arm.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.020
It's really nothing.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.310
And just what would you do if the wound got infected?

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:55.930
Please stop, Milady. There's no need for that.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.110
Why is that?

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.030
Well, Milady Kihel...

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.740
It's like you're treating me far too kindly all of a sudden.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:05.240
I keep expecting to get punished for everything.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:07.530
Punished?

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:14.920
You're suggesting that an elegant lady should serve as your punisher? That's rather crude.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.410
I'm sorry...

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.420
Get back!

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:27.430
The fight is still going on out there.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:29.220
The war is still expanding...

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.060
Ouch...

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:36.220
Please, pardon me!

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:39.610
You've matured quite a bit these days, Loran.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:41.240
It's fine.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:44.520
Thank you so much, Lady Kihel.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:48.410
What?

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.030
The battle's...

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.140
Uncle Sid!

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.610
Why are you here?

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.820
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.030
Did the Colonel send you?

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:29.910
Not quite. I was forced down here by the Dianna Counter Mobile Suits.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.620
Then, I'm glad you're okay.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:32.910
What is all of this?

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:36.130
There may be even more mechanical dolls buried underground in this area.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.420
We're excavating to find them.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:40.710
Even if we only find one, you'd still want it, right?

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:43.340
But there's a battle taking place above us.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:45.340
We're not soldiers.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:47.930
Our priority is finding these treasures.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.810
Does that pathway there reach the surface?

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.430
I've little interest in what's over there.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:53.510
Shouldn't we check? Let's go look.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:11.540
It's not around here.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:14.710
There's no point to our attack if we can't capture the Mustached unit.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.960
I'll send some of my men out to check for it.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:22.340
Sounds good to me. The Zenoa team should concentrate on investigating this Mountain Cycle.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.630
Okay.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:26.970
I'll let that one man find the Mustached mobile suit.

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:31.310
I'll get it for ya!

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:32.430
One more thing...

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:34.730
Dianna Counter will not supply you with more units.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:36.520
You will have only the two Gozzo.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:37.520
That's all.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:40.310
That's fine with me if it means I don't someone constantly pestering me.

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:42.020
Bruno, Jacop...

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:45.030
Let's head out and find that White Mustached Gundam!

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.730
Yes Sir!

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:57.540
What, is the Sergeant some briefcase now?

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.030
Did you get in touch with them?

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:05.130
What about the Mountain Cycle?

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.720
It's no good.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.430
Dianna Counter's acting like they own the place.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:10.720
And Vicinity?

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.180
They haven't been there.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:14.310
Sid and his people...Did you find any survivors?

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:18.020
No, I've heard they relocated somewhere else.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.310
But frankly, I can't say for sure.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:25.440
In short, you're saying we've lost the mechanical reinforcements we wanted to uncover?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.440
Wasn't Nocis also badly damaged?

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:40.420
I've heard Guin Rhineford has abandoned Nocis.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:43.130
Is that what the report says?
 - Yes.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:47.120
The heir has abandoned the capital of Inglessa?

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:03.230
Now that Guin's altered our situation...

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:07.530
Our Militia will reorganize and join forces with Luzianna's Militia.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.240
A Militia alliance?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.410
Correct.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:14.120
We'll also consider uniting all the Militias in the Ameria Continent.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.200
Gather each of their respective commanders!

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:20.120
Reports suggest that Luzianna discovered...

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.880
...another mountain similar to our Mountain Cycle.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:27.000
I don't like this. He doesn't believe our own mechanized forces are up to the task.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.410
I wonder where Loran went?

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:31.420
- We need to gather our respective forces and combine our strengths.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.730
It's been a long time, Sir Guin.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.110
Have you been waiting long?

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:49.520
I haven't been waiting long enough to give me reason to complain.

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:53.530
You could've just come directly to our place, you know?

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.530
My father's there now.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.030
l don't want to see him at this time.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:01.830
So, you're still upset about what my father said.

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.210
"One day, Guin Sard Rhineford will be taken down a notch, and I can't wait to see it.",

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.350
Is that it?

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:09.340
He was correct.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:12.840
Then if I'm right, there's another reason you asked me here...

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:17.000
Is it to allow me to get a ride in this great plane?

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:19.640
l have a request.

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:22.430
Go ahead.

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:25.440
From now on... the negotiations between the moon and earth...

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:28.230
...will be held Luzianna, where Duke Borjarno reigns.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.530
My father mentioned that as well. So?

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:35.070
Since l can't be there personally, I'd like to establish an inside source of intel on our enemy's plans.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.740
You mean a spy?

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:40.760
You want me to become your little pipeline of intel?

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:42.410
I could easily do that!

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.040
I've been so bored.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:46.860
Working as a spy sounds wonderful!

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:49.540
Now, would you mind if look inside this thing?

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.840
Miss Lily Borjano...

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:56.640
I don't plan on vanishing just quite yet.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.810
Loran, are you sure that you're alright?

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.060
You should take a break.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:09.110
I'm not tired. Milady, allow me to...

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.570
...take you to a place where you won't be harmed.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.380
I'm counting on you, Loran.

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:16.610
Counting on me...

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:21.160
Milady, are you alright!?

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.330
Did you fall off!?

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.660
I'm perfectly fine.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:26.620
Thank goodness...

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:30.700
Loran, there's another hole off to the right.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:37.630
Milady, please wait here for me.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:40.710
The enemy might be up there!

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:47.520
Is it not around here?

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.610
It's here somewhere!

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:53.980
If we can't find it...

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.400
Make it come out and find us!

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:59.280
Fire your railgun to draw him out!

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:01.730
Roger that, Sergeant!

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:03.540
Jacop, do it.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.030
Right!

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:13.540
That's right! This is what a man's life should be like!

00:10:18.570 --> 00:10:20.210
Hold your fire!

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:22.710
What is it?

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:26.640
Doesn't something seem out of place here?

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:31.520
Go and inspect that one spot by the dust clouds.

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:45.970
We can't go out that way. Let's try going to the left.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:49.620
This place has the same texture as that one point at Mountain Cycle.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.420
Why don't we take a look...

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:54.500
Are you alright, pops?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:55.920
Do I look alright?

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.920
Don't bother with me. Continue the investigation!

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:01.010
The old man's getting agitated.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.050
But where do we set up to begin working?

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:07.020
Limestone caverns sitting above volcanic ashes...

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:13.050
...and below the ground has a layer which is loose like sand, and brittle as a wafer.

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:18.140
It has the same properties and features as found in Mountain Cycle.

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:21.610
I can't see a thing...

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:24.240
Too much interference for the sensors...

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:25.910
Can't tell anything for sure.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:28.870
Just keep firing your railgun, and I'm sure that'll drag him out.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.620
There's a lot of heat under the ground.

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:34.660
Would that be wise?

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:37.340
Are you afraid of a volcano erupting in your face or something?

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:38.920
Quit goofing around, you two!

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.420
Right!

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:55.720
Did that come from the direction where Milady Kihel's at?

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:59.690
Did the battle shift locations?

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:02.240
That sound came from somewhere underground.

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:06.320
It's the sound you hear when gas starts pouring out of the earth.

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:20.590
Those bastards Phil and Zenoa just keep jerking me around!

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:21.560
SHOW YOURSELF!

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:29.340
Do you think our leader's getting fed up with this search?

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:31.430
I wonder if we'll be able to slip away unnoticed?

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.230
Ahh, not good, not good!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:36.930
Why did fate leave us stuck here with this jerk of a sergeant?

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:53.040
Loran Cehack pulled it off?

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.670
I don't think they can use their weapons now.

00:12:57.270 --> 00:13:00.000
What type of Mobile Suits are these?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.210
Were these made on the moon?

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.130
The pilots are gone.

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:09.810
Nothing but the name "Gozzo"

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:10.850
Lady Kihel!

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:13.560
Loran, were there any more enemies?

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.640
There was at least one more.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:18.400
Only one? Then perhaps I can talk them into stopping.

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:22.110
What are you thinking? We're leaving this place and searching for another way out.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.610
I'm sorry. I've heard that...

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:29.320
I resemble the leader of our enemy, so I was hoping to try negotiating.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:34.830
Milady, I never imagined you'd be able to come up with such radical ideas.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:37.540
Disguises are difficult things to maintain convincingly.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.330
Lady Kihel must be...

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:45.130
Bruno and Jacop STILL haven't returned with news of finding the White Mustache yet!?

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:48.010
Pops, what is this?

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:50.300
What? Have you found a new treasure?

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.560
Here, what's this?

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:57.600
This looks like a bomb from the Mountain Cycle.

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:58.930
Uh oh...

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:00.610
This is bad!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:03.110
Get out of here!

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:08.440
What's that!?

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:16.680
They have mines in a place like this?

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:20.130
Did that bastardly Gundam sneak in this route?

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.670
Ooh, there's people here!

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.830
A Mechanical Doll!

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:38.520
- Isn't there another way out?
- We can't go back that way!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.440
Those were the ones excavating down here, right?

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:43.640
That's right. It looks like the ceiling collapsed.

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:45.530
Loran, run!

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:47.610
You shouldn't go that way!

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:48.740
Why not?

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:52.030
Some of the enemy's mechanical dolls are over there, incapacitated!

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.990
Then where should we go?

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:55.410
I will stay here and keep him back.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:59.120
Take the lady and get her away from here!

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:00.330
Loran?

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.420
I'll be fine!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:04.090
There are some narrow passages in the rocks that you should be able to sneak through.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.510
Sid, I'm entrusting the lady to you!

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:07.880
Okay!

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:11.130
Have its legs been damaged?

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:13.180
That boy will be just fine.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.510
That boy?

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:17.890
He's, by far, the Militia's best pilot.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:25.940
You damned White Mustached Gundam, I know that you're here...

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:28.230
Come on out!

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:31.600
I knew it'd be that strange Mobile Suit.

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:35.610
Found you!

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:48.830
He... This pilot wants to duel me hand to hand?

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:50.420
You want this?

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:51.930
Please allow me to borrow it.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.260
Pops...

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:54.720
What is it?

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:57.100
The lady asked me to loan her this gun.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:58.850
I must go back on my own.

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.640
- Guard the escape exit.
- Right!

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.440
Milady...

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:03.520
Kihel Heim.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:06.440
It's not proper for a lady to use that sort of thing.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.610
It's not what you believe.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:11.400
Cook, Morris, come with us!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:15.020
Loran, you're certainly a brave member of the Moonrace.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.530
I can't stand straight!

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:23.500
What!? He's...

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:27.840
Well then Gundam... please forgive me for being so blunt, little miss pilot.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:33.920
You're Laura Rola, right? Well, badly piloting the White Mobile Suit yourself isn't courteous at all!

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:39.630
So that's how it is, eh?

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:57.940
The sound of a cave-in...

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.910
Kihel Heim...

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:03.680
We can't monitor the battle if we just stand here.

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:08.830
It's not just sulfur. The smell's getting even stronger! Don't!

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:21.640
What's this? Do these strips of nanoskin hold the monitor together?

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:26.770
It doesn't matter, the unit's still operational.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:29.140
The system should still hold up, but...

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:32.070
It's so hot!

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:38.240
The monitor is working now?

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:39.610
That man...

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:46.040
Little miss Laura, you're still not dead yet, right?

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:48.270
There's plenty more where that came from!

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:50.630
Can the White Doll not defend against him?

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:52.800
Come on, move!

00:17:55.070 --> 00:17:59.130
It's just as I said, Little Miss Laura Rola!

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:11.440
Do you understand, Miss?

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:13.530
Once that bubbly magma melts you away...

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:16.110
You'll simply be reduced to a part of the earth!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:18.860
It's not like I've always hated you or anything.

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:21.030
But in my mind...

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:24.040
...there's some strange memories of the Gundam humiliating me!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:27.080
AND I CAN'T STAND IT ANYMORE!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.530
He hates the sight of "Gundam"?

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:41.640
Why won't you fall, little miss?

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:44.010
Corin Nander!

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:46.310
Her Majesty!?

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.600
Milady Kihel?

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:48.940
Excellent work.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:51.310
Corin Nander, your mission has ended.

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:53.760
You may now leave!

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:55.820
What is this, your Majesty!?

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:59.400
It's the Gundam! Can't you see the Gundam in front of me, right here!?

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.740
Since when does a Gundam have a mustache?

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:07.620
It doesn't. The times have changed, and your mission has come to an end.

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:11.820
If you disobey my order, I will have you put to death!

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:15.420
Your Majesty...

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.130
You may leave.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:19.760
You've gained more than your share of sins.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.720
Is this it!?

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.230
Fall!

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:39.230
Melt and vanish in the magma!

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.350
Corin!

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:43.240
You disobeyed a direct order!

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:44.910
I, Dianna Soriel, now have no other choice.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:46.440
You are sentenced to death!

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:49.700
Dianna Soriel?

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:53.540
My only desire has been to fight for the Queen's happiness!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.030
Who do you think you are?

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:56.910
Here!

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:10.430
I'm not falling down there!

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:35.040
How did I know?

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.420
It was because...

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:41.010
The military had warned me about that particular officer. I had been told he had numerous interesting quirks.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.630
Is that it?

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:46.640
Just the same, you were very brave, Milady.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:49.510
I was truly very surprised.

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:52.020
Sir Guin trained me to handle a crisis like this.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.730
This issue wasn't any different.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.100
That's true.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:57.020
There are still a lot of things that I need to learn...

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.730
Otherwise, I'll never be as confident with myself.

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:03.740
You've done an excellent job. I too was surprised by you.

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:05.520
Really?

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.940
It'd be good if you got some rest.

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:22.120
Milady...

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:22.120
<i>Ojousan</i>

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:25.040
Milady...

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:25.040
<i>Ojousan</i>

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:32.430
You are one, and yet you are two.

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:32.430
<i>Anata hitori de futari kamo</i>

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:38.100
One was born in the sunlight...

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:38.100
<i>Hizashigatsukuru fukuramito</i>

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:45.030
...the other was birthed by the moon's light.

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:45.030
<i>Tsuki no hikari no mou hitori</i>

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:50.410
Two different paths are before you now.

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:50.410
<i>Anata yuku michi futatsu demo</i>

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:56.410
Allow me to help you with my own hands.

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:56.410
<i>Te wo kashimashou kono boku no</i>

00:21:56.410 --> 00:22:04.120
The moonlight is shining on your face...

00:21:56.410 --> 00:22:04.120
<i>Tsuki no hikari no usugeshou</i>

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:16.130
I've fallen in love with the overlapping shadows.

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:16.130
<i>Kazanaru kage ni koi kokoro</i>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:39.990 --> 00:23:42.270
<i>We avoided Dianna Counter's attack...</i>

00:23:42.270 --> 00:23:44.480
<i>...and then find ourselves in a valley.</i>

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:46.860
<i>While there, Milady Kihel has an encounter...</i>

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:48.570
<i>...with a digger, Mister Will.</i>

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:51.860
<i>He wants to prove the legend about the Girl of the Moon and his Ancestor.</i>

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:55.240
<i>And I also have an incident with a Miss Teteth...</i>

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:56.940
<i>...while at the hot springs.</i>

00:23:57.740 --> 00:24:00.460
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN A GUNDAM...

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:02.670
<i>An Older Person</i>

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:06.870
"The wind of memory excites one's heart."

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>An Older Person</b>
